135
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,200
En cas d'un dena.

136
00:05:50,300 --> 00:05:51,800
Bueno, vaig cap allà.

137
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:52,520
A veure, no sé.

138
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:02,440
Bueno, acabo d'arribar.

139
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,300
Estan obrint portes.

140
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:06,720
M'hauré col·locat millor, però...

141
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:06,980
Bueno.

142
00:06:08,820 --> 00:06:09,960
Bueno, doncs a veure.

143
00:06:10,320 --> 00:06:12,020
A veure quant trigo a comprar el tiquet.

144
00:06:17,080 --> 00:06:19,500
La situació és que sóc al...

145
00:06:19,500 --> 00:06:21,260
Bueno, vintè de la cua,

146
00:06:21,580 --> 00:06:22,760
