Bueno, tu, mira.

153
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:36,940
He pogut menjar una mica de crispetes dolces

154
00:06:36,940 --> 00:06:38,440
que no m'agraden, però...

155
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,440
