206
00:08:17,420 --> 00:08:18,920
Perquè potser, no ho sé, no ho sé.

207
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:21,160
Jo no ho faré, perquè he vist que

208
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,320
el llencen a les

209
00:08:22,320 --> 00:08:24,200
