210
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:26,160
Són una mica rars.

211
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,540
Crec que a Pakistan també menjarem

212
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:32,560
bastant de chai, te.

213
00:08:33,140 --> 00:08:34,140
A l'hora de demanar

214
00:08:34,140 --> 00:08:36,740
